clueweb09-en0000-88-32756.0 [Deer Creek Farm - Fayetteville, Arkansas - Hunter Jumper, Fox Hunting, Basic Dressage] Deer Creek Farm Diane Gooderl 17681 Wyman Road Fayetteville . AR . 72701 479.530.5959 diane @ deercreekfarm . info [Deer Creek Farm - Fayetteville, Arkansas - Hunter Jumper, Fox Hunting, Basic Dressage]Deer Creek Farm is located in a tranquil valley, at the base of Round Mountain, with vistas of the White River bluffs. A five minute canter across open fields will award you a beautiful view of the White River and on hot summer days, the horses love to cool off and splash in the river. The hundreds of acres to trail-ride on make Deer Creek Farm a unique equestrian facility. While emphasis is placed on safe and proper riding, trail rides are part of the regular training program. Horses live in their natural environment....outdoors, with large open run-in-sheds, for shelter as needed, and horse friendly fencing.
