clueweb09-en0006-63-01860.0 [] [] [] [] [] Welcome to Cross Creek Farm [] [] [] [] Home Cross Creek Farm FEI Rider Lauren Matthews Juri's Story Onsite Trainer: Joe Eaton Clinician Mary Werning News & Show Results Watercolor Gallery Contact Us [] [] [] [Home1.jpg] Cross Creek Farm is an exclusive dressage training facility in Oak Ridge, NC. Conveniently located on 40 acres near the Piedmont Triad Airport, the facility is dedicated to the training and advancement of the serious dressage rider. [Home2.JPG] The farm offers the following amenities: 12 X 12 Stalls in a spacious, airy barn Rubber mats, fans, & auto fly-misters Hot & cold wash stalls Private or semi-private turnout Pastures fenced & cross fenced Security gate Around the clock supervision & security Regulation sized dressage arena Lighted 120 x 225 fenced ring with all weather footing Mirrors [Home3.JPG] Cross Creek Farm is owned and operated by Graham and
